    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>&quot;This game contains adult language and scenes of explicit violence, as well as flashing lights.&quot;</u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Argument:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Andy, a young man who is grappling with the inner demons of his dark past.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the depths of his mind, you will confront the deceptions and illusions that threaten to devour him. Solve puzzles and unravel the secrets of the shadows of his consciousness. Can you distinguish reality from fiction before it's too late for Andy? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game delivers a thought-provoking <strong>experience that will make you question the nature of sanity and perception.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>&quot;This game contains adult language and scenes of explicit violence, as well as flashing lights.&quot;</u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Argument:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Andy, a young man who is grappling with the inner demons of his dark past.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the depths of his mind, you will confront the deceptions and illusions that threaten to devour him. Solve puzzles and unravel the secrets of the shadows of his consciousness. Can you distinguish reality from fiction before it's too late for Andy? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game delivers a thought-provoking <strong>experience that will make you question the nature of sanity and perception.</strong></p>",
